msgid ""
"Since I was a little baby, I've been afraid of spiders.\n"
"But this whole place is full of them!\n"
"Please kill [FF0000]20 spiders[-].\n"
"Let me know when you are finished.\n"
"(I bet this is the last I'll hear from this guy...)"
msgstr "我从小宝宝的时候起，就一直害怕蜘蛛。\n"
"但这整个地方到处都是蜘蛛！\n"
"请杀掉[FF0000]20只蜘蛛[-]。\n"
"你完成后告诉我。\n"
"（我敢打赌，这是我最后一次听到这家伙的消息了……）"

msgid "Who are you? What do you want?\nDid someone send you down here?"
msgstr "你是谁？你想干什么？\n是有人派你下来的吗？"

msgid "Did someone send you down here?"
msgstr "是有人派你下来的吗？"

msgid "(whimper) I saw... I saw.... A HUGE SPIDER!\nIt said \"WHO DISTURBS ARAGOG!\" and I ran as fast as I could out of there!\nThat thing is straight out of my nightmares...\nI can't eat, sleep or even breathe knowing that that creature is out there.\nPlease HELP ME!!!"
msgstr "（抽泣）我看见了……我看见了……一只巨大的蜘蛛！\n它说“是谁打扰了阿拉戈克！”，然后我就拼了命地逃了出来！\n那东西简直就是从我噩梦里爬出来的……\n一想到那怪物就在外面，我吃不下、睡不着，连呼吸都困难。\n求求你帮帮我！！！"

msgid "Talk to Hugo."
msgstr "与雨果交谈。"

msgid "Get rid of it! Just... get rid of it!\n[FF0000]KILL ARAGOG[-]!\nYou can summon him with the Aragog spawner I showed you how to make."
msgstr "除掉它！就……除掉它！\n[FF0000]杀死阿拉戈克[-]！\n我可以教你怎么制作的阿拉戈克刷怪箱来把它召唤出来。"

msgid "[FF0000]KILL ARAGOG[-]! You can summon him with an Aragog spawner."
msgstr "[FF0000]杀死阿拉戈克[-]！你可以用阿拉戈克刷怪箱召唤它。"

msgid "You did it? Really?\nThen bring me his eye so I know it's safe!"
msgstr "你做到了？真的吗？\n那就把他的眼睛带来给我，这样我才能确定安全了！"

msgid "Tell Hugo you have killed Aragog."
msgstr "告诉雨果你已经杀死了阿拉戈克。"

msgid "Bring me [FF0000]Aragog's eye[-] so I know it's safe!"
msgstr "把[FF0000]阿拉戈克的眼睛[-]带来给我，这样我才能确定安全了！"

msgid "Wow, how did you do it?!\nThat beast looked so scary!\nHere, take some apples as a reward."
msgstr "哇，你是怎么做到的？！\n那野兽看起来太可怕了！\n来，拿些苹果作为奖励吧。"

msgid "Bring Hugo Aragog's eye."
msgstr "把阿拉戈克的眼睛带给雨果。"

msgid "Please kill [FF0000]20 spiders[-]. Let me know when you are finished."
msgstr "请杀死[FF0000]20只蜘蛛[-]。完成后告诉我。"

msgid "What?! You're still alive?!\n(Maybe Ted was right... he's not as useless as he looks.)"
msgstr "什么？！你还活着？！\n（也许泰德说得对……他并不像看上去那么没用。）"

msgid "Tell Hugo you have killed the spiders."
msgstr "告诉雨果你已经杀死了蜘蛛。"

msgid "It looks like these spiders just never stop coming.\nI think they have nests around here somewhere... Yes... I think they come from the spider webs you see around the caves.\nPlease bring me [FF0000]10 spider webs[-]."
msgstr "看来这些蜘蛛根本杀不完。\n我想这附近某处应该有它们的巢穴……对……我觉得它们就是从你在洞穴周围看到的蜘蛛网里出来的。\n请给我带[FF0000]10个蜘蛛网[-]来。"

msgid "I think the spiders come from the webs around the caves. Please bring me [FF0000]10 spider webs[-]."
msgstr "我觉得蜘蛛是从洞穴周围的蜘蛛网里来的。请给我带[FF0000]10个蜘蛛网[-]来。"

msgid "Yes! It worked, no more spiders! I can finally sleep!\nTake some apples, they'll restore your health."
msgstr "太好了！成功了，再也没有蜘蛛了！我终于能睡觉了！\n拿些苹果吧，它们能恢复你的生命值。"

msgid "Bring Hugo the spider webs."
msgstr "把蜘蛛网带给雨果。"
